{'symbol': 'EQIX', 'date': '2021-12-07 03:00:00', 'title': 'EQUINIX TO EXPAND INTO AFRICA WITH ACQUISITION OF MAINONE', 'text': "REDWOOD CITY, CALIF., DEC. 7,\xa02021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EQUINIX, INC. \xa0(NASDAQ: EQIX), THE WORLD'S DIGITAL INFRASTRUCTURE COMPANY™,\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS EXPANSION INTO AFRICA THROUGH ITS INTENDED ACQUISITION OF MAINONE, A LEADING WEST AFRICAN DATA CENTER AND CONNECTIVITY SOLUTIONS PROVIDER, WITH PRESENCE\xa0IN NIGERIA, GHANA AND CÔTE\xa0D'IVOIRE."}